Description: face unlock for the lock screen, sudo and polkit
 Linux Hello unlocks the lock screen and authenticates sudo and polkit
 prompts with your face, using an infrared camera when there is one. This
 package has the service, the PAM module and the command line tool; the
 settings come with linux-hello-kde (System Settings on Plasma) and
 linux-hello-gnome (the Face Unlock app).
 .
 Ships its own Python runtime with OpenCV and dlib.

