 qml6-module-qtquick-layouts,
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: face unlock page in KDE System Settings
 The Face Unlock page in System Settings > Security & Privacy, where faces
 are added and face unlock is turned on for the lock screen, sudo and polkit.

